{"v":4,"catch":"在 11 天內從被遺忘的星球上走出來。","desc":"這是一款探索解謎遊戲。 不幸的救援人員只有 11 天的時間來擺脫這個長期被所有人遺棄的星球上的陷阱。\n\n一次科考船捕捉到求救信號，但由於著陸不成功，救援行動徹底失敗。 您將不得不尋找庇護所並適應紅色星球的惡劣條件，即使船員中有五個人，您也只能依靠自己。\n\n你必須探索廢棄的基地並保衛它，在沙漠中進行突襲並收集金屬進行設備維修。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2022-12-01","genres":["冒險","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","德文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7bd74dc331da88a9126d6ca39dcceb75cfbfcc0afff90dcdb02c16df5cdb821f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5fbff41f7e80aab4fff289db54d16b2a15ab8cc2cf2398677efc53e39311f38.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/76b2447630a4e4529f4e495544cea933856844769c8d5fe0635012f4d2c3e027.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f6362632ba1c007c76ebb1fb52ed79b50e533aa259ba3e231558271c60f940cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f6c307a7241f301286f17ae6dd519de0de1985b4d4199fcdfcb43a17a73924db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a46e8d6f3e8fde1b6a8b984797a80ce70063ca8988e37fce287f8dab9f38ce9e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c7501360c000","dlc":[]}